•	Terrain Visualization: Customizable color schemes, overlays, and opacity
•	Elevation Extraction: Single point or batch coordinate export to CSV/Excel
•	Analysis Tools: Hillshade, slope, contours, drainage patterns, construction difficulty
Network-Terrain Analysis:
•	Evaluate elevation profiles, slopes, and gravity-fed potential
