Best Practices
•	Ensure DEM CRS matches network coordinates
•	Use appropriate DEM resolution for scale:
o	Regional: 30–90 m
o	Site: 1–10 m
o	Detailed engineering: <1 m
•	Workflow: Load DEM → visualize → analyze slopes/ruggedness → overlay network → extract elevations → generate reports
Interpretation Guidelines:
•	Slope: 0–2° flat, 2–5° gentle, 5–15° moderate, 15–30° steep, >30° very steep
•	Elevation zones: valleys, lower/mid/upper slopes

